('127.481.d.14.G',4,'When the immune system mistakenly attacks the body''s own tissues, the condition is called an:','["tumor", "autoimmune disease", "allergy", "infection"]'::jsonb,1,'Autoimmunity attacks self.','original'),
('127.481.d.15.A',3,'The long tube from the mouth to the anus through which food passes is the:','["aorta", "trachea", "alimentary canal", "lymph duct"]'::jsonb,2,'The alimentary canal is the GI tract.','original'),
